sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Engineer
    participant Client as Python script
    participant CatC as Catalyst Center
    participant Dev as Switch
    U->>Client: python3 flows.py
    activate Client
    Client->>+CatC: GET /dna/intent/api/v1/network-device
    Note right of CatC: activation bar:<br/>CatC is busy
    CatC-->>-Client: 200 OK [edge1, edge2]
    CatC-)Dev: push config (async: open arrowhead,<br/>sender does not wait)
    Dev--)CatC: done (later)
    deactivate Client
    Note over U,Dev: solid line = request · dashed line = response · time runs DOWN
